{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0603_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6fa51d4305cef63b981b9eab501b4fc78f3d06fba0af77296de620f1e2732a8b", "ja": "（『アイドル水着大運動会』が大好評に終わり、\n今日は海辺の町でのキッズイベントに呼ばれている）", "zh": "（《偶像泳装大运动会》大受好评地落下了帷幕，今天又受邀参加海边小镇的儿童活动）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0603_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "05e1eaf09380cb79dfde25dc44d597005045ef44375c98fe3842bcd25e52cf67", "ja": "ということで！　今日はみんなに、\n砂のオブジェを作ってもらいまーす☆", "zh": "所以嘛！今天要请大家一起制作沙子雕塑——☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0603_1002_029umi", "source_sha256": "3e4aa52866da2755716072f3a209b0d6aa10ec94c90f1923bed050ee453410e9", "ja": "オブジェは何でもいいの。雪だるまとか、車とか、\nお城とか！　お友達の顔とかでもいいと思うよ！", "zh": "造型什么都可以。雪人啦、车啦，\n城堡啦！做成朋友的脸也没问题哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0603_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "efe4299e92c2124a1463a35644c74b33b63c29a12c12a0cc73203e4ae3f9d297", "ja": "あとで完成したオブジェの中から一等賞を選ぶから、\n最後まで崩さないように気を付けてね！", "zh": "之后要从完成的作品中选出第一名，所以要小心，千万别在最后之前弄塌了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0603_1004_029umi", "source_sha256": "a67d355d9182457b6acaed63524a0c7b3e4bb2ed1908c435b74dc0580629fd58", "ja": "あと、これから大事なことを言いまーす！　まず、\n子供だけで絶対に海に入らないこと。それから～……。", "zh": "还有，接下来我要说一件很重要的事情——！首先，\n小孩子绝对不能自己跑进海里。然后呢～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0603_1005_null", "source_sha256": "494fa7cf2920e00f31d70c39f224838e92e217ce28d6551ddb665731e0695eca", "ja": "イベント終了後……", "zh": "活动结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0603_1006_p", "source_sha256": "e1038ec4b3fee65d4cbf61a01db2ee4c6fbc4e6fef6cc348428e24a6b9960195", "ja": "海美、お疲れさま。来てくれた子供達、\nみんなすごく楽しんでくれたな。", "zh": "海美，辛苦了。来参加的孩子们，大家都玩得特别开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0603_1007_029umi", "source_sha256": "0d8b673f670e449f6af914d739a449b0feb9665feabad8063b4c10f3150d1bff", "ja": "うん！　オブジェもすっごく上手なのばっかり！\n宇宙船とか、ライオンとか、変な顔の猫とか♪", "zh": "嗯！大家做的作品也都特别棒！有宇宙飞船、狮子，还有表情奇怪的猫咪♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0603_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "7214f89b629aa93c354d2af4de2b513cfcc63577e1af5cac5832ccbd267eea35", "ja": "どれも素敵で、一番を決めるの大変だったよ～。", "zh": "每一个都很棒，要选出第一名可真不容易啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0603_1009_p", "source_sha256": "ed2b9f88c63f2d04186cba9c934e908cbbdd10f32642677d49e9bec137141649", "ja": "でも『一番を決める』ってアイディアは、海美が\n言い出しちゃったからなぁ。打ち合わせの時に……。", "zh": "不过，“决出第一名”这个主意，是海美在开会时……提出来的嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0603_1010_029umi", "source_sha256": "0959c303d186ca1c2961aedc3e99c35a73f2feb227e29b4d35b07f341732234f", "ja": "えへへ～、あの時は勝手にごめんなさい。\nアイディアがあったら是非って言われて、つい……。", "zh": "嘿嘿～那时候擅自做主，真是不好意思。\n听到有人说“有想法的话尽管提”，我就忍不住……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0603_1011_p", "source_sha256": "cbce9f6d7af85b8eb38279f94e3a4639cdc830b276a49c7e68f5c68e79d8befe", "ja": "いいや、良かったと思うよ。\n実際今日の子供達も、すごく楽しんでくれたし。", "zh": "不是，我觉得挺好的。\n实际上，今天的孩子们也玩得特别开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0603_1012_029umi", "source_sha256": "aacefb36e082acfdda0a08f7aa27e43f902b1db82c4efba133204eaa35e671e0", "ja": "うん……。私ね、この前の『アイドル水着運動会』で、\nわかったんだ。", "zh": "嗯……我啊，在之前的《偶像泳装运动会》上，明白了一件事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0603_1013_029umi", "source_sha256": "e75290d50e25701f74f14664ddf2974324630f4f1034637f3e5dafbe1ed45799", "ja": "普通に遊ぶのも楽しいけど、一番を目指して\n全力で遊ぶのも楽しいなーって！", "zh": "普通地玩固然开心，但全力以赴争第一也很有意思——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0603_1014_p", "source_sha256": "84d3f2e07e2c392df9e43b6424146b2434e8e857f602fc0b3447b5c60b084dfb", "ja": "その通りだと思うよ。\n遊びでもそうだし、きっと遊び以外のことでも。", "zh": "我也觉得就是这样。\n不仅是玩耍，其他事情肯定也是如此。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0603_1015_029umi", "source_sha256": "b9d367b67e6099c9474eff620429782868370f0b181b82da6fffc967cf47b313", "ja": "そうだよね！　遊びでも、アイドルでも。\nレッスンでも、ステージでも！", "zh": "没错吧！不管是玩耍、当偶像，\n还是练习、登台！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0603_1016_029umi", "source_sha256": "c5ef849e6dc4608d352c8e4a21457e330b5bce8997165a815f52ffcd0b2ba7f4", "ja": "{$P$}。私、これからも全力で、\n思いっきり走り抜けて、思いっきり楽しみたい。", "zh": "{$P$}。我今后也想全力以赴，尽情奔跑到底，尽情享受这一切。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0603_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0603_1017_029umi", "source_sha256": "fad28b75cf00228fef88c3116245e469b2911591f01a70c11d1ebbee01c67c5f", "ja": "だから、一緒に走ってね！　だって私ひとりじゃ、\nやっぱりちょっと寂しいから……。えへへ☆", "zh": "所以，要和我一起奔跑哦！因为只有我一个人的话，果然还是有点寂寞……嘿嘿☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
